                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "44289963",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197975895891",
                            "num_reviews": 441,
                            "playtime_forever": 221,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 221,
                            "last_played": 1534842901
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Well, you look at the trailers and already know that this game doesnt seem polished to the end.\nI kinda had fun with the game but there are some big issues which lead me to the point that I cant recommend the game.\n\n-Let me start with the biggest technical problem: I couldnt finish the game. Played through 53% of the game. The game always keep crashing when in this one area. Just get anerror and thats it. Its kind of gamebreaking but to be honest: I was already in mood to stop playing this game, so yeah...the game made the descision for me. Can live with that.\n\n-The other technical stuff is fine. Graphic is not really good but okay enough.\n\n-Now my biggest problem with the game. The camera is toooooooooooooooooooooooooooo damn close to the character. This is a stealth game but you cant see whats going on five metres away from you. Most of time you spend turning your camera. But also then there are some things so far away that you cant seem them or doesnt exactly where to go. Those parts end in trial and error stuff. This game makes you feel whole time that you want to zoom out but you just cant.\n\n-All the mechanics of the game are not really deep and especially those boss fights are very bad. Game would be much better without them. All those trial and error passages and boss fights are not well executed. \nIt would be okay for me if you could plan your actions with better camera and wouldnt have this gamebreaking bug. So I have to stop play this game and give it a negative review.\n\n\n(I mentioned the thing about the camera in the discussion forum. Nobody replied so it seems like developer doesnt care anway and moved on).",
